OL,3,GNEWSAGolden retrievers to gather at the
OL,4,Abreed's ancestral Highland home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mass gathering of golden retrievers
OL,7,Fand their owners is to return to the
OL,8,Fancestral home of the breed in July
OL,9,F2028.
OL,11,FThe event will mark 160 years since the
OL,12,Ffirst golden retriever puppies were
OL,13,Fborn at Guisachan House in Glen Affric,
OL,14,Fnear Cannich, in the Highlands.
OL,16,FMeetings to celebrate the breed have
OL,17,Fbeen held in different formats by the
OL,18,FGolden Retriever Club of Scotland since
OL,19,Fthe late 1990s, with larger events
OL,20,Ftaking place since 2006.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
