OL,3,GNEWSAGolden retrievers to gather at the
OL,4,Abreed's ancestral Highland home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last gathering held at Guisachan in
OL,7,F2023 involved almost 500 dogs from 12
OL,8,Fcountries.
